{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 31,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 559.97,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that after the end of Korihor,",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.291,
      "end": 5.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Alma having received tidings",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.654,
      "end": 9.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Zoramites were perverting the ways of the Lord,",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.549,
      "end": 17.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that Zoram, who was their leader, was leading the hearts of the people to bow down to dumb idols,",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 17.81,
      "end": 22.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his heart again began to sicken because of the iniquity of the people.",
      "verse": "31:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.995,
      "end": 28.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it was the cause of great sorrow to Alma to know of iniquity among his people;",
      "verse": "31:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 29.166,
      "end": 36.782,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore his heart was exceedingly sorrowful because of the separation of the Zoramites from the Nephites.",
      "verse": "31:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 37.462,
      "end": 41.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Zoramites had gathered themselves together in a land",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 41.543,
      "end": 43.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they called Antionum,",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 43.627,
      "end": 46.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was east of the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 46.501,
      "end": 49.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which lay nearly bordering upon the seashore,",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 49.653,
      "end": 51.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was south of the land of Jershon,",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 52.155,
      "end": 55.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which also bordered upon the wilderness south,",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 55.493,
      "end": 58.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which wilderness was full of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "31:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 58.867,
      "end": 60.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Nephites greatly feared",
      "verse": "31:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 60.951,
      "end": 65.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Zoramites would enter into a correspondence with the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "31:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 65.821,
      "end": 70.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that it would be the means of great loss on the part of the Nephites.",
      "verse": "31:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 71.331,
      "end": 78.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, as the preaching of the word had a great tendency to lead the people to do that which was just\u2014",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 78.57,
      "end": 83.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, it had had more powerful effect upon the minds of the people than the sword,",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 83.858,
      "end": 86.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or anything else, which had happened unto them\u2014",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 86.685,
      "end": 92.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore Alma thought it was expedient that they should try the virtue of the word of God.",
      "verse": "31:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 93.17,
      "end": 96.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore he took Ammon, and Aaron, and Omner;",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 96.694,
      "end": 99.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Himni he did leave in the church in Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 99.846,
      "end": 102.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the former three he took with him,",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 102.348,
      "end": 106.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Amulek and Zeezrom, who were at Melek;",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 106.197,
      "end": 108.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also took two of his sons.",
      "verse": "31:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 109.013,
      "end": 111.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the eldest of his sons he took not with him,",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 112.072,
      "end": 113.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his name was Helaman;",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 113.924,
      "end": 118.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the names of those whom he took with him were Shiblon and Corianton;",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 118.284,
      "end": 124.414,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these are the names of those who went with him among the Zoramites, to preach unto them the word.",
      "verse": "31:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 125.094,
      "end": 128.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Zoramites were dissenters from the Nephites;",
      "verse": "31:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 128.571,
      "end": 131.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they had had the word of God preached unto them.",
      "verse": "31:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 132.548,
      "end": 134.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But they had fallen into great errors,",
      "verse": "31:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 135.096,
      "end": 141.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they would not observe to keep the commandments of God, and his statutes, according to the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "31:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 142.417,
      "end": 145.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Neither would they observe the performances of the church,",
      "verse": "31:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 145.987,
      "end": 149.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to continue in prayer and supplication to God daily,",
      "verse": "31:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 149.325,
      "end": 151.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not enter into temptation.",
      "verse": "31:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 152.327,
      "end": 157.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, in fine, they did pervert the ways of the Lord in very many instances;",
      "verse": "31:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 157.476,
      "end": 164.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, for this cause, Alma and his brethren went into the land to preach the word unto them.",
      "verse": "31:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 164.936,
      "end": 167.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, when they had come into the land,",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 167.392,
      "end": 172.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, to their astonishment they found that the Zoramites had built synagogues,",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 172.588,
      "end": 176.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they did gather themselves together on one day of the week,",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 176.855,
      "end": 179.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which day they did call the day of the Lord;",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 179.543,
      "end": 184.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did worship after a manner which Alma and his brethren had never beheld;",
      "verse": "31:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 185.517,
      "end": 189.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For they had a place built up in the center of their synagogue,",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 189.83,
      "end": 192.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a place for standing, which was high above the head;",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 192.982,
      "end": 195.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the top thereof would only admit one person.",
      "verse": "31:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 196.634,
      "end": 199.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, whosoever desired to worship",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 199.322,
      "end": 200.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "must go forth",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 200.942,
      "end": 203.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stand upon the top thereof,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 203.444,
      "end": 206.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stretch forth his hands towards heaven,",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 206.364,
      "end": 209.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cry with a loud voice, saying:",
      "verse": "31:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 209.923,
      "end": 212.617,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Holy, holy God; we believe that thou art God,",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 212.797,
      "end": 214.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we believe that thou art holy,",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 215.113,
      "end": 217.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that thou wast a spirit,",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 217.801,
      "end": 219.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that thou art a spirit,",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 220.024,
      "end": 222.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that thou wilt be a spirit forever.",
      "verse": "31:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 223.212,
      "end": 227.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Holy God, we believe that thou hast separated us from our brethren;",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 227.99,
      "end": 231.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we do not believe in the tradition of our brethren,",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 231.421,
      "end": 236.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was handed down to them by the childishness of their fathers;",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 236.338,
      "end": 239.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we believe that thou hast elected us to be thy holy children;",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 240.001,
      "end": 244.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also thou hast made it known unto us that there shall be no Christ.",
      "verse": "31:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 245.093,
      "end": 248.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But thou art the same yesterday, today, and forever;",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 248.663,
      "end": 251.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou hast elected us that we shall be saved,",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 251.815,
      "end": 256.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whilst all around us are elected to be cast by thy wrath down to hell;",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 256.639,
      "end": 259.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the which holiness, O God, we thank thee;",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 259.884,
      "end": 262.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we also thank thee that thou hast elected us,",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 263.175,
      "end": 267.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may not be led away after the foolish traditions of our brethren,",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 268.045,
      "end": 271.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth bind them down to a belief of Christ,",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 271.29,
      "end": 275.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth lead their hearts to wander far from thee, our God.",
      "verse": "31:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 276.335,
      "end": 278.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again we thank thee, O God,",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 278.744,
      "end": 281.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we are a chosen and a holy people.",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 281.618,
      "end": 282.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "31:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 283.134,
      "end": 288.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that after Alma and his brethren and his sons had heard these prayers,",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 288.515,
      "end": 290.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were astonished beyond all measure.",
      "verse": "31:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 291.517,
      "end": 295.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, every man did go forth and offer up these same prayers.",
      "verse": "31:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 296.237,
      "end": 299.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the place was called by them Rameumptom,",
      "verse": "31:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 299.203,
      "end": 301.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which, being interpreted, is the holy stand.",
      "verse": "31:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 302.53,
      "end": 307.778,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, from this stand they did offer up, every man, the selfsame prayer unto God,",
      "verse": "31:22",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 307.958,
      "end": 310.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thanking their God that they were chosen of him,",
      "verse": "31:22",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 310.785,
      "end": 315.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he did not lead them away after the tradition of their brethren,",
      "verse": "31:22",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 315.191,
      "end": 321.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that their hearts were not stolen away to believe in things to come, which they knew nothing about.",
      "verse": "31:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 322.605,
      "end": 326.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, after the people had all offered up thanks after this manner,",
      "verse": "31:23",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 326.779,
      "end": 330.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they returned to their homes, never speaking of their God again",
      "verse": "31:23",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 331.092,
      "end": 338.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had assembled themselves together again to the holy stand, to offer up thanks after their manner.",
      "verse": "31:23",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 339.156,
      "end": 342.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Alma saw this his heart was grieved;",
      "verse": "31:24",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 342.308,
      "end": 345.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he saw that they were a wicked and a perverse people;",
      "verse": "31:24",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 345.971,
      "end": 350.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he saw that their hearts were set upon gold, and upon silver,",
      "verse": "31:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 350.238,
      "end": 352.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon all manner of fine goods.",
      "verse": "31:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 353.24,
      "end": 358.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and he also saw that their hearts were lifted up unto great boasting, in their pride.",
      "verse": "31:25",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 359.446,
      "end": 361.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he lifted up his voice to heaven,",
      "verse": "31:26",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 361.948,
      "end": 363.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cried, saying:",
      "verse": "31:26",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 363.893,
      "end": 365.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O, how long, O Lord,",
      "verse": "31:26",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 365.606,
      "end": 374.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou suffer that thy servants shall dwell here below in the flesh, to behold such gross wickedness among the children of men?",
      "verse": "31:26",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 375.202,
      "end": 376.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, O God,",
      "verse": "31:27",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 376.729,
      "end": 378.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they cry unto thee,",
      "verse": "31:27",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 378.581,
      "end": 381.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and yet their hearts are swallowed up in their pride.",
      "verse": "31:27",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 381.965,
      "end": 383.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, O God,",
      "verse": "31:27",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 383.492,
      "end": 385.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they cry unto thee with their mouths,",
      "verse": "31:27",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 385.855,
      "end": 390.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while they are puffed up, even to greatness, with the vain things of the world.",
      "verse": "31:27",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 391.04,
      "end": 392.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, O my God,",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 392.613,
      "end": 394.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their costly apparel,",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 394.418,
      "end": 400.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their ringlets, and their bracelets, and their ornaments of gold,",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 400.217,
      "end": 403.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all their precious things which they are ornamented with;",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 403.694,
      "end": 406.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, their hearts are set upon them,",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 406.521,
      "end": 408.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and yet they cry unto thee and say\u2014",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 409.116,
      "end": 410.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We thank thee, O God,",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 410.921,
      "end": 415.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we are a chosen people unto thee, while others shall perish.",
      "verse": "31:28",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 416.152,
      "end": 421.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they say that thou hast made it known unto them that there shall be no Christ.",
      "verse": "31:29",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 422.08,
      "end": 423.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord God,",
      "verse": "31:30",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 423.328,
      "end": 428.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how long wilt thou suffer that such wickedness and infidelity shall be among this people?",
      "verse": "31:30",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 428.616,
      "end": 429.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "31:30",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 429.818,
      "end": 431.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou give me strength,",
      "verse": "31:30",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 431.809,
      "end": 434.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may bear with mine infirmities.",
      "verse": "31:30",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 434.357,
      "end": 439.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I am infirm, and such wickedness among this people doth pain my soul.",
      "verse": "31:30",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 439.96,
      "end": 440.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "31:31",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 441.162,
      "end": 443.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my heart is exceedingly sorrowful;",
      "verse": "31:31",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 443.757,
      "end": 446.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou comfort my soul in Christ.",
      "verse": "31:31",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 446.213,
      "end": 447.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "31:31",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 447.415,
      "end": 450.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou grant unto me that I may have strength,",
      "verse": "31:31",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 450.614,
      "end": 457.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may suffer with patience these afflictions which shall come upon me, because of the iniquity of this people.",
      "verse": "31:31",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 458.446,
      "end": 459.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "31:32",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 459.648,
      "end": 462.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou comfort my soul, and give unto me success,",
      "verse": "31:32",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 463.125,
      "end": 469.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also my fellow laborers who are with me\u2014 yea, Ammon, and Aaron, and Omner,",
      "verse": "31:32",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 469.296,
      "end": 472.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Amulek and Zeezrom, and also my two sons\u2014",
      "verse": "31:32",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 473.005,
      "end": 475.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even all these wilt thou comfort, O Lord.",
      "verse": "31:32",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 475.925,
      "end": 478.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, wilt thou comfort their souls in Christ.",
      "verse": "31:32",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 479.159,
      "end": 482.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wilt thou grant unto them that they may have strength,",
      "verse": "31:33",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 482.776,
      "end": 490.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may bear their afflictions which shall come upon them because of the iniquities of this people.",
      "verse": "31:33",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 490.979,
      "end": 492.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "31:34",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 492.181,
      "end": 498.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou grant unto us that we may have success in bringing them again unto thee in Christ.",
      "verse": "31:34",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 499.223,
      "end": 500.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, O Lord,",
      "verse": "31:35",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 500.796,
      "end": 502.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their souls are precious,",
      "verse": "31:35",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 502.694,
      "end": 505.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many of them are our brethren;",
      "verse": "31:35",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 505.242,
      "end": 508.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, give unto us, O Lord, power and wisdom",
      "verse": "31:35",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 508.812,
      "end": 512.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may bring these, our brethren, again unto thee.",
      "verse": "31:35",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 513.207,
      "end": 516.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that when Alma had said these words,",
      "verse": "31:36",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 516.684,
      "end": 519.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he clapped his hands upon all them who were with him.",
      "verse": "31:36",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 520.115,
      "end": 522.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, as he clapped his hands upon them,",
      "verse": "31:36",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 523.081,
      "end": 525.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were filled with the Holy Spirit.",
      "verse": "31:36",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 526.501,
      "end": 533.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after that they did separate themselves one from another, taking no thought for themselves what they should eat,",
      "verse": "31:37",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 533.322,
      "end": 537.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or what they should drink, or what they should put on.",
      "verse": "31:37",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 537.903,
      "end": 540.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord provided for them",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 540.544,
      "end": 542.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should hunger not,",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 542.628,
      "end": 544.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither should they thirst;",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 544.666,
      "end": 547.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and he also gave them strength,",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 547.214,
      "end": 550.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should suffer no manner of afflictions,",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 550.459,
      "end": 553.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were swallowed up in the joy of Christ.",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 553.379,
      "end": 556.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was according to the prayer of Alma;",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 556.253,
      "end": 557.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 557.455,
      "end": 559.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because he prayed in faith.",
      "verse": "31:38",
      "lineIndex": 155
    }
  ]
}